{"PageNumber":252,"Verses":[{"SurahNumber":13,"SurahIndex":"013","VerseNumber":19,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"۞أَفَمَن يَعۡلَمُ أَنَّمَآ أُنزِلَ إِلَيۡكَ مِن رَّبِّكَ ٱلۡحَقُّ كَمَنۡ هُوَ أَعۡمَىٰٓۚ إِنَّمَا يَتَذَكَّرُ أُوْلُواْ ٱلۡأَلۡبَٰبِ","TajweedText":"۞ أَفَم<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>َن ي</tajweed>َعْلَمُ أَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َم<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> أُ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نز</tajweed>ِلَ إِلَيْكَ م<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>ِن ر</tajweed>َّبِّكَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْحَقُّ كَمَنْ هُوَ أَعْمَ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ىٰٓ‌ۚ</tajweed> إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َمَا يَتَذَكَّرُ أُ<tajweed class=slnt>وْ</tajweed>لُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَلْبَ<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ـٰ</tajweed><tajweed class=qalaqah>ب</tajweed>ِ <span class=end>١٩</span>","End":"١٩","PageNumber":252,"JuzNumber":13,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":207,"MaqraNumber":101,"HizbNumber":26,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":13,"SurahIndex":"013","VerseNumber":20,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"ٱلَّذِينَ يُوفُونَ بِعَهۡدِ ٱللَّهِ وَلَا يَنقُضُونَ ٱلۡمِيثَٰقَ","TajweedText":"ٱلَّذِينَ يُوفُونَ بِعَهْدِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهِ وَلَا يَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نق</tajweed>ُضُونَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمِيثَ<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ـٰ</tajweed><tajweed class=qalaqah>ق</tajweed>َ <span class=end>٢٠</span>","End":"٢٠","PageNumber":252,"JuzNumber":13,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":207,"MaqraNumber":101,"HizbNumber":26,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":13,"SurahIndex":"013","VerseNumber":21,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَٱلَّذِينَ يَصِلُونَ مَآ أَمَرَ ٱللَّهُ بِهِۦٓ أَن يُوصَلَ وَيَخۡشَوۡنَ رَبَّهُمۡ وَيَخَافُونَ سُوٓءَ ٱلۡحِسَابِ","TajweedText":"وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لَّذِينَ يَصِلُونَ م<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</ta